('bmlt-labmanagement1-practice-019','BMLT','BMLT NHPC Licensing','mcq','free',19,'{"question":"The purpose of a biological safety cabinet is to:","translation":"","options":["Protect personnel, sample and environment when correctly used","Store all chemicals permanently","Replace hand hygiene","Incinerate waste"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"उपयुक्त biological safety cabinet ले aerosol जोखिम नियन्त्रण गर्न सहयोग गर्छ।","explanationNe":"उपयुक्त biological safety cabinet ले aerosol जोखिम नियन्त्रण गर्न सहयोग गर्छ।","topic":"Laboratory Management, Quality Assurance & Safety"}'::jsonb,true),
